{
  "info": {
    "name": "Robfarrel Backend – AI & Credit Burn APIs",
    "description": "Only the APIs added for the AI integration: `/ai/*` and `/credit-usage`.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Set `baseUrl` (default `http://localhost:5000/api/v1`).\n2. Log in with the existing `POST /auth/login` and paste `data.accessToken` into the `token` variable (landlord or tenant). Paste an admin token into `adminToken` for **Credit usage (admin)**.\n3. Set `propertyAnalysisId` to a property analysis id (`GET /property-analyses`).\n\n**Credits**: each run needs a balance of at least `AI_MIN_CREDITS_TO_RUN` (else **402**). Credits burned = ceil(`total_tokens` / `AI_TOKENS_PER_CREDIT`), charged once when the run finishes `completed` or `partial`; failed runs are free.\n\nEvery AI request saves `data.runId` into the `runId` variable.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "propertyAnalysisId",
